WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.640
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old!

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:03.810
Last time, she went to the beach,

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.310
and met a really cool guy there.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.040
Mitsuki got a boyfriend...

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.730
...and I went on a date with Takuto at the beach!

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:10.780
Or, so we thought...

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.120
But that guy was actually a womanizing jerk!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.070
In the end, his girlfriend found out...

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.600
...and we saved her from his trickery.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.650
Summertime sure is full of perils.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:10.380
Okay.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.060
We're done.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.990
Thank you very much.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.530
Working as a model sure is busy, isn't it?

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.190
Yep!

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.190
But it's lots of fun!

00:02:21.590 --> 00:02:22.150
Is that so?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.320
Well, it's summer vacation, so don't overwork yourself.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.410
Okay!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.910
What did Dr. Wakaouji say?

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:32.890
He said that since it's summer vacation, I shouldn't push myself too hard.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:33.910
I see.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:00.860
Kinda like this?

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:02.650
Yep, yep. {Good girl}

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.320
That's perfect.

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:08.740
But... why am I doing a shampoo commercial?

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.670
Would you rather do one for makeup?

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.680
I-It's too early for makeup!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.460
Your songs are selling...

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.960
Your fans adore you...

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.000
Now we're signing commercial deals... {shani: but who is getting the monies?!?!}

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.170
This is the next step.

00:03:24.130 --> 00:03:25.260
Really?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.410
Once you do a commercial, your face will be all over television and magazines.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.880
It's a little... embarrassing. {alpha time}

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:31.890
It's a little... embarrassing. {alpha time}

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.520
But it's the fastest way to get 
Eichi-kun to notice you.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:47.570
Okay!

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:49.110
I'm going to do my best!

00:03:49.110 --> 00:03:50.650
Good, good. That's the spirit.

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.710
So, Ooshige-san...

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.330
When's the shoot supposed to be?

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.240
Ah... about that...

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:58.660
It's not set in stone yet...

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.320
You'll have to audition first.

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.680
That would be tomorrow.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:06.300
You should tell me these things sooner!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.680
F-Forgive me!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.840
Hey.

00:04:11.840 --> 00:04:13.350
How's this?

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.600
My hair has split ends...

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.810
Geez, Meroko.

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:24.610
You have to take proper care of your hair.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.070
A girl's hair is her life.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:27.620
Hmph.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.900
I don't want to hear that coming from you!

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:31.200
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.990
Just kidding. I'm just messing with you!

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.700
Oh, come on, Meroko.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:36.870
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:39.910
Hey.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.160
What do you think, Takuto?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:41.750
Eh?

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.040
Are you against her doing a commercial?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:44.420
Eh?

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:45.630
Really?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.960
N-Not really.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:47.810
Ah.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.400
What's with the attitude?

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.840
It's unpleasant...

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:54.850
Why do I have to be so happy if she's going to be in a commercial?

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:56.890
I'm going out for a walk.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:04:59.270
Takuto...

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.160
What's with him?

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.690
He's all grouchy...

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.100
...and he's usually the first to be happy for you...

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.750
Hey... you think so too, don't you?

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.160
Eh?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.250
Don't you think that Takuto's been awfully strange lately?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.960
Ever since what happened the other day... he's been acting differently.

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.040
What happened...?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:29.550
Ah.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:36.850
Hmm?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:39.840
You know something, don't you?

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:41.260
Nope... nothing...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.780
I-I'm going to sleep!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.610
Something funny's going on with the two of them.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.200
What?!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.710
Meroko's coming to the audition with me?! {Blasphemy}

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.190
That's because...

00:06:11.190 --> 00:06:14.000
...Takuto doesn't seem too enthusiastic about it.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.680
Plus, I should get to go out once in a while!

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:18.830
But...

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.150
I-It's okay every now and then, isn't it?

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:36.700
Eh?

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:37.490
Um...

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.310
All right!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:39.430
I'm so happy!

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.410
Takuto, watch the house then, 'kay?

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:42.120
Yeah.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.930
La la la la la la la. {alpha time, on second thought...}

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:03.800
Going out! Going out!

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.230
Going out! Going out!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.980
La la la la la la la.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.000
Going out! Going out!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.530
Going out! Going out!

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.150
Ah...

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.820
I don't get it...

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:17.950
What's wrong?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:18.970
N-Nothing at all. {alpha time}

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:20.030
N-Nothing at all. {alpha time}

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:20.820
Really?

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.800
Um...

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.170
Where was it?

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:34.590
What? What?

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.130
You don't know how to get there?

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.130
In that case, leave it to me!

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:43.120
Let's see... this way!

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.210
We've already passed through here.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.000
It's this way, then!

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.870
We've been here already...

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.020
Then, here!

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:52.650
Over there!

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:55.350
This way!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.940
We're completely lost.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.250
I wonder if Ooshige-san will come pick me up.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.800
Are you lost?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.330
Eh?

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.300
Ah, you're... {a devil in disguise}

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.880
We met at the Seed Record audition, right?

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:19.880
That's right.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:23.000
Thank you for your help back then.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:23.910
That is...

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:26.040
I... didn't know anyone...

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.850
...and when I was feeling lonely... you talked to me...

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.190
I guess so.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:31.800
That's right.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.810
Congratulations on that earlier accomplishment.

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.310
Thank you very much!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.420
By the way... where are you headed?

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.030
Um...

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.490
This place.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:44.380
Ah.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:47.720
If that's where you're going, you should take the train to the next station...

00:08:47.720 --> 00:08:49.580
...and from there, it'll be faster to just walk.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.510
Hold on a second.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:52.410
I'll write it down on your map.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:54.460
But...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:56.340
...do people go that far for others just like that? {shani: what are you saying Meroko?}

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:58.720
Okay.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:08:59.260
Here you go.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.370
Ah, okay.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:01.560
Wow!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.300
Thank you so much!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.050
No problem.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:05.290
You're welcome.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.310
I'll do as you said, then.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.260
Good luck.

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:08.840
Okay!

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:17.230
You trust others too much, <i>Full Moon</i>. {Yeah, that's kind of her weakness of sorts}

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.400
If you don't hurry, it'll start!

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.660
I know that!

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:28.580
Ah.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:29.410
She's here!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.130
Ooshige-san!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.270
You're late, you know.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:33.920
What happened?

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:34.980
I'm sorry.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.560
I got lost...

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:38.920
I would have picked you up if you had called...

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:45.930
I met this nice person on the way who gave me directions.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:46.850
From Shinbashi...

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.140
Shinbashi?

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:49.560
You came from Shinbashi?!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:51.430
It says to get off at Yurakucho, doesn't it?

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.120
Look.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.600
Eh?!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:55.520
No way!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:57.440
Why...?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.690
It's that girl...

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:02.280
Ah!

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:09.160
It looks like you managed to get here in one piece.

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:11.200
T-That was mean of you!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.200
Sorry about that.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.670
I was just playing around.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:16.420
Eh?

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.660
I didn't expect you to actually believe me...

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:20.380
Oh well.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.340
I guess you could call it payback for before.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.340
Payback?

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.300
You...

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.180
...said you didn't have connections...

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.300
...but you obviously did, right?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.930
Totally in the dark...

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.810
I said all that with the intention of winning...

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.140
Wait!

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.770
I really didn't have any connections!

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:37.960
Oh...

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:39.280
I wonder if that's true.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.320
In that case... why don't we try this.

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:43.640
This audition...

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:46.200
Let's do this fair and square.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:51.490
What's with that girl?!

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.160
That's Real Music's Wakamatsu Madoka.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:56.830
As far as I know...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.510
...she's your biggest rival for this audition.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.090
Eh?

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.130
Really?

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.720
The other rivals are...

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.870
They're all rivals.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:55.020
They're all people I've seen on TV or in magazines.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.560
You're kidding!

00:11:56.560 --> 00:11:58.480
That's Wakamatsu Madoka?!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.020
I didn't notice it until you mentioned it.

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:02.020
Right?

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:05.250
She was so ordinary when she was a child actor.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.090
Yep!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.090
Yep!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.430
It's almost like she's a completely different person.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.860
Could it be that she had plastic surgery?! {edited}

00:12:10.860 --> 00:12:12.740
I don't know about that.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:14.970
But... she sure cleaned up nicely.

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.660
I couldn't possibly be like her.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:28.830
Hey, hey!

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.010
What are you so nervous about?

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.440
I guess it can't be helped.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.810
To help you out during the audition...

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:39.270
...I'll give you advice.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:42.930
Okay?

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:45.320
Be sure to respond sincerely and distinctly.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:45.770
Okay.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.730
In any case, just relax.

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:48.340
Okay.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.280
Stand up straight.

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:51.150
Okay!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:55.080
Your answers should be clear and snappy.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:55.700
Okay!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.160
Look straight into their eyes while you're talking.

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.210
Yes, ma'am! {The "yes sir" thing even when referring to a woman is an annoying epidemic still plaguing fansubs today}

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.500
Very good.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.460
Let's go then!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:03.020
Okay!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:06.810
Huh?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:07.990
What's wrong?

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:10.460
The door won't open!

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:11.510
What?!

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.430
Is it broken?

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:15.930
Hey!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.890
Is anyone there?!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:26.450
I was sure she'd be here, 
now where'd that Mitsuki go?

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.880
The audition's about to start.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:30.650
Ooshige-san!

00:13:32.920 --> 00:13:33.780
Mitsuki!

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:35.300
Where'd you run off to?

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.490
Sorry.

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.360
The bathroom door wouldn't open...

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.330
Anyways... at least you made it in time.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:43.640
This is the new concept that they just handed out for their product.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.240
Look it over at least once.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:46.170
Okay.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:47.470
It's that girl.

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:53.170
She had to be the one who did it!

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:53.930
No way...

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.680
Don't just jump to conclusions like that! {Edited from "Don't just assume whatever you want!"}

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.880
Also... you will be interviewed in pairs.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.270
That's how the judges have decided to do it.

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.640
Well... that's who you'll be with...

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.820
The person over there seems happy about it for some reason...

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.070
Don't lose!

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:13.570
Okay!

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:15.110
I'll do my best!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.040
It's almost time...  {I added a new color style for Takuto in this case, check the style sheet}

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:24.580
Ah!

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:26.040
Wait!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.790
Why am I worrying about it?! {Takuto as Mitsuki is still awkward}

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:29.960
After the people ahead of you come out...

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.670
...please go in and take their places. {and take their...}

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.340
Okay! {madoka}

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.340
Okay!{Furu muun}

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.640
I'm totally positive that what happened in the bathroom...

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.420
...was all her doing.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.940
You're still talking about that...

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.400
You managed to get out, huh?

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:52.000
See! Look!

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.900
So she did do it!

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:56.360
Is there someone that you like?

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:56.780
Huh?

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:58.170
Stay calm!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:02.160
She's trying to make you lose your composure before the interview!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.830
What difference does it make if there is one?

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:10.710
The worst thing that can happen to someone doing commercials is a scandal.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:13.930
The image of the product would be instantly ruined.

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:14.710
That's why...

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.590
...if a scandal were to happen during the contract period...

00:15:17.590 --> 00:15:19.470
The company behind the commercial would, of course...

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:23.260
...terminate the deal accordingly.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:24.840
R-Really?

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.680
What should we do then?! {The person, or in this case, Shinigami giving advice is wondering what to do, lol} {shani: Meroko <3 totally took the bait!}

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.240
I wonder if Meroko can handle it...

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.200
No.

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.240
It doesn't matter.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:49.580
Of course, I use Mermaid Tear shampoo every day!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:53.290
All the beauty parlors say Mermaid Tear is great.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.850
It's all I've used since!

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.410
Hey, hey!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.550
Don't look so uneasy.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.720
I'll come up with the perfect thing to say!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.120
Meroko... that's...

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:24.030
And... what about you, <i>Full Moon</i>-san?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:24.700
Ah.{Furu muun}

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:24.700
Ah. {Meroko}

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:27.040
How do you fit the shampoo's image?

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:27.500
Ah...

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.250
I...

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.000
That is...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.250
Ever since I was little, I've always wanted hair that would bounce!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:37.800
All right!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.710
Bounce, huh?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.240
Fire!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.010
Oh crap!

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:47.040
It's too strong!

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.390
Stop it, Meroko!

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:50.730
I'm trying!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.940
Um...please excuse me.

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:54.690
This isn't really anything...

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:55.480
Um...

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:58.320
Enough!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.820
Ah... it stopped.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:03.490
U-Um...

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.030
Ta-da!

00:17:06.030 --> 00:17:07.790
Isn't it bouncy?!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.210
You're quite funny.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:32.730
Or something like that...

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.320
Well, that's it for the interview.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.070
Ah, okay.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.450
Thank you very much! {Furu muun}

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.450
Thank you very much! {Madoka}

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.960
Ah... by the way...

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.520
<i>Full Moon</i>-san...

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.700
Shouldn't you tell them about <i>that</i>.

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.160
Eh?!

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.580
You have someone that you like, right? {Low-blow, I cry foul}

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:57.080
How could she say that at a time like this?!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.350
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:00.290
I said it out loud!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.920
Did I do something wrong?

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.050
Uh... not really...

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:03.510
Huh?

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.510
What is this?

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:06.220
Um...

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:08.010
That's...

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.310
Say that you don't have one!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.520
Cover it up!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.180
Cover it up...?

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:04.650
What's wrong?

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:05.670
There is!

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:08.730
There's someone I like! {There's also someone I like, and that is sleep, I was up at 1 am at the time of this writing, lol}

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:09.870
Oh man...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.330
That's the worst thing for an image... {and a bitter, spiteful broad is a good imejii}

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.070
What?!

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:19.290
You told them?!

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:19.830
Yeah.

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.120
Oh well... it can't be helped...

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.590
That's just how you are, huh?

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.710
I see.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:32.050
So it doesn't look too good, huh?

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:33.670
Well, don't worry about it.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.120
It's just one audition...

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:38.060
Okay... bye.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:40.690
So...

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.000
Meroko couldn't pull it off after all... {it wasn't Meroko's fault, props to Mitsuki for honesty}

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.030
Ah. Meroko, where'd you go?

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:54.910
I got a phone call... from Takuto...

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.340
Takuto? What'd he say?

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:57.940
He said not to worry about it.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:19:59.870
Really...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.930
We would like to congratulate everyone on a job well done.

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.180
Well, now I'll announce the results of the audition.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:21.560
Eh... the judges have decided...

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:24.440
The Image Character for Mermaid Tear will be...

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:32.110
Real Music's Wakamatsu Madoka-san.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.490
Thank you very much! {XP}

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:36.850
We're counting on you.

00:20:36.850 --> 00:20:37.500
Okay!

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:48.380
Well... we're not done yet.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.470
Village Pro's <i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:51.220
Yes!

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.930
You also fit the commercial image perfectly.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.450
I-I do?!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:55.930
Yes.

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:58.520
Way to go, Mitsuki!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.730
Thank you very much!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.370
That's all.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:07.670
We'll change the setup of the commercial...

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:09.820
...and both of you will appear together.

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.840
W-What's that?! {So much for "even", Mitsuki still shines above you in the end}

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:12.900
Madoka-san.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.440
I'm so glad that I get to work with you!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:18.450
Let's work hard together!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:23.750
Please, just choose one of us!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:24.120
What?

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:25.960
I can't stand this girl! {and your true nature makes an appearance for all to see}

00:23:06.060 --> 00:23:07.310
Takuto, you idiot!

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:11.020
Why did you tell Mitsuki that 
you were once a human?!{edited}

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:11.690
Shove it!

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:12.780
That's my choice to make!

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:13.530
Choice?

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:14.970
Hey Takuto...

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:20.530
You do know what will happen if we Shinigami fully recover our pasts as humans...

00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:22.030
I know!

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:23.070
I'm fine!

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:24.490
Leave me alone!

00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:25.580
Hey, Takuto!

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:27.000
Wait!

00:23:27.670 --> 00:23:29.920
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:31.170
Two Different People
